          "native": "八百五十円です。お箸はご利用ですか。",
          "reading": "happyaku gojuu en desu. ohashi wa goriyou desu ka",
          "english": "That's 850 yen. Would you like chopsticks?",
          "speak": "はっぴゃくごじゅうえんです。おはしはごりようですか。",
          "replies": [
