          "native": "はい、チェックアウトの後もお預かりできます。",
          "reading": "hai, chekkuauto no ato mo oazukari dekimasu",
          "english": "Yes, we can keep it after check-out too.",
          "speak": "はい、チェックアウトのあともおあずかりできます。",
          "replies": [
            {
              "next": "n5",
